<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE- Gefco income slips, cautions holders.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Gefco income slips, cautions holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   3.0	vs     3.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    0.15	vs     2.06</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    1.18	vs     3.57</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.03	vs     1.51</p>
<p>    Interest received	2.32	vs     1.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		  14.21	vs    19.70</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil	vs     1.64</p>
<p>Increase in distrib</p>
<p>    reserves for period    4.91	vs     4.84</p>
<p>Div payable: September 26</p>
<p>On register: August 29</p>
<p>Full name: The Griqualand Exploration and Finance Company Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings due to the accumulation of substantial cash reserves as a result of the discontinuation of the firm's blue asbestos operations.</p>
<p>The company said proposals on how to deal with funds currently surplus to the group's ongoing requirements were under consideration and subject to necessary approvals.</p>
